		{"id":"3f9a2b17c04d8e61","type":"text","text":"# Dataset Factory 总体架构图","x":0,"y":0,"width":900,"height":70},
		{"id":"7c1e5d92a6b04f38","type":"text","text":"本地优先的 AI 数据集打标桌面工具 · Web 与 CLI 双入口共用同一核心 · 仅 LLM 能力层对外通信","x":0,"y":80,"width":980,"height":60},
		{"id":"b2d4f6a8c0e19372","type":"text","text":"**打标闭环已交付**","x":1020,"y":10,"width":240,"height":44,"color":"#f59e0b"},
		{"id":"1829304152637475","type":"text","text":"- dsf run 跑批\n- dsf export 导出\n- dsf workdir 维护\n- dsf strategy 策略\n- dsf service 管理本地服务（五组同口径）","x":580,"y":280,"width":340,"height":150},
		{"id":"2930415263747586","type":"text","text":"双入口行为对等，由契约测试保障","x":580,"y":445,"width":340,"height":90},
		{"id":"0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e","type":"text","text":"复刻自 Dataset Factory 协作仓 asset/docs/architecture.svg","x":0,"y":1930,"width":700,"height":30},
		{"id":"9203a1b2c3d4e5f6","type":"text","text":"本地数据（数据根 ~/.dataset_factory；凭据不进导出包）","x":0,"y":1430,"width":940,"height":40},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60718","type":"text","text":"**工作目录 .dsf/**（与素材同级，可多个；清理 / 删除 / 迁移维护链）\n\n- `imports.jsonl` —— 素材登记（哈希 / 白名单 / 复制或就地采用）\n- `strategies/sN.json` —— 批次策略快照（序号只增，copy-on-apply）\n- `runs/<时间戳>/` —— run.json · items.jsonl · run.log · 产物 txt","x":0,"y":1480,"width":460,"height":240,"color":"#22c55e"},
		{"id":"b2c3d4e5f6071829","type":"text","text":"**全局数据根 ~/.dataset_factory**\n\n- `endpoints` —— 端点配置与密钥（页内 chip 选择，无全局指针）\n- `prompts` / `skills` —— 提示词库与技能包的源\n- 应用配置、缓存、导出临时区与 quarantine 回收","x":480,"y":1480,"width":460,"height":240,"color":"#22c55e"},
		{"id":"c3d4e5f607182930","type":"text","text":"**质量底座**\n\n测试金字塔：pytest 1290 / Vitest 421 / E2E 45 / L4 27 屏 · 契约：OpenAPI 79 + oasdiff 相邻门禁\nimport-linter ×3 契约 · dep-cruiser ×5 规则 · CI：双系统六 job","x":0,"y":1760,"width":940,"height":120,"color":"#94a3b8"},
		{"id":"d4e5f60718293041","type":"text","text":"**打标页**\n\nworkdir · batching · runs · materials · hooks","x":20,"y":280,"width":155,"height":100},
		{"id":"e5f6071829304152","type":"text","text":"**提示词工作台**\n\nstrategy · editor · chat","x":185,"y":280,"width":155,"height":100},
		{"id":"3041526374758697","type":"text","text":"**api** · HTTP REST + SSE 流式端点（OpenAPI 79 · 12 个路由模块）","x":40,"y":720,"width":420,"height":55},
		{"id":"41526374758697a8","type":"text","text":"**cli** · 命令行入口（跑批 / 导出 / 工作目录 / 策略 / 服务）","x":480,"y":720,"width":420,"height":55},
		{"id":"819203a1b2c3d4e5","type":"text","text":"## 云端模型 Provider\n\nOpenAI 兼容 / 自定义端点\n\n导出目标格式：MiniMax H3（适配层未建设）\n\n**全系统唯一网络出站方向**","x":1100,"y":950,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"#2563eb"},
		{"id":"f607182930415263","type":"text","text":"**设置页**\n\nendpoints · skills · service","x":350,"y":280,"width":150,"height":100},
		{"id":"0718293041526374","type":"text","text":"app-shell：进程保活 + 三页保活跨重启恢复\n\ndep-cruiser 5 条规则 · 前端手写源码 24945 行","x":20,"y":400,"width":480,"height":120},
		{"id":"526374758697a8b9","type":"text","text":"**labeling 打标引擎**\n\n批次执行 · 失败分类\n六分组状态监控","x":40,"y":865,"width":270,"height":80},
		{"id":"6374758697a8b9ca","type":"text","text":"**tasks 任务编排**\n\nSSE start / delta / done\n停止 / 续跑控制 · 事件流","x":330,"y":865,"width":270,"height":80},
		{"id":"74858697a8b9cadb","type":"text","text":"**runs 跑批执行**\n\n哈希断点续跑 · 并发占用锁\n停止两档 · 重试列表常驻","x":620,"y":865,"width":280,"height":80},
		{"id":"9697a8b9cadbecfd","type":"text","text":"**workdir**\n\n登记导入\n清理 / 删 / 迁","x":40,"y":1170,"width":135,"height":80},
		{"id":"a8b9cadbecfd0a1b","type":"text","text":"**strategies**\n\n快照冻结\n损坏自愈","x":185,"y":1170,"width":135,"height":80},
		{"id":"b9cadbecfd0a1b2c","type":"text","text":"**sessions**\n\nevents.jsonl","x":330,"y":1170,"width":135,"height":80},
